[DA] ✔ B: 1. Verdenskrig

123
00:12:41.224 --> 00:12:42.562
Question 3.

124
00:12:42.512 --> 00:12:48.037
When was North Schleswig, today called South Jutland, reunited with Denmark?

125
00:12:48.037 --> 00:12:50.687
Option A: 1864.

126
00:12:50.687 --> 00:12:53.024
Option B: 1901.

127
00:12:53.024 --> 00:12:55.380
Option C: 1920.
[DA] Hvornår blev Nordslesvig, i dag kaldet Sønderjylland, genforenet med Danmark?  A: 1864  |  B: 1901  |  C: 1920

128
00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.368
The answer is C: 1920.

129
00:13:04.317 --> 00:13:08.670
It appeared in the November 2021 and May 2024 exams.
[DA] ✔ C: 1920

130
00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.520
Question 4.

131
00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:14.445
When was the land border between Denmark and Germany last changed?

132
00:13:14.445 --> 00:13:16.895
Option A: 1720.

133
00:13:16.895 --> 00:13:19.233
Option B: 1820.

134
00:13:19.233 --> 00:13:21.600
Option C: 1920.
[DA] Hvornår er landegrænsen mellem Danmark og Tyskland sidst blevet ændret?  A: 1720  |  B: 1820  |  C: 1920

135
00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.588
The answer is C: 1920.

136
00:13:30.538 --> 00:13:33.426
It appeared in the November 2024 exam.
[DA] ✔ C: 1920

137
00:13:33.976 --> 00:13:35.439
Question 5.

138
00:13:35.389 --> 00:13:38.301
When did Denmark get its first female minister?

139
00:13:38.301 --> 00:13:40.826
Option A: 1924.

140
00:13:40.826 --> 00:13:43.514
Option B: 1947.

141
00:13:43.514 --> 00:13:46.332
Option C: 1975.
[DA] Hvornår fik Danmark sin første kvindelige minister?  A: 1924  |  B: 1947  |  C: 1975

142
00:13:52.882 --> 00:13:55.557
The answer is A: 1924.

143
00:13:55.507 --> 00:14:01.590
It appeared in the November 2020, November 2023 and June 2026 exams.
[DA] ✔ A: 1924

144
