[DA] Hvem var Danmarks første socialdemokratiske statsminister?  A: Thorvald Stauning  |  B: Jens Otto Krag  |  C: Anker Jørgensen

156
00:14:47.146 --> 00:14:49.734
The answer is A: Thorvald Stauning.

157
00:14:49.684 --> 00:14:54.078
It appeared in the November 2021 and May 2023 exams.
[DA] ✔ A: Thorvald Stauning

158
00:14:54.628 --> 00:14:55.891
Question 8.

159
00:14:55.841 --> 00:14:59.216
